{"seq":1,"slug":"ingestion-pipeline","title":"高吞吐摄取","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/ingestion-pipeline","wordCount":1438,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"高吞吐摄取\">高吞吐摄取</h1><p>一个中型 Kubernetes 集群每秒能吐出几十万到上百万个指标点，工业 IoT 现场更可达千万级。这股洪流若直接打到磁盘做随机写，再强的存储引擎也会瞬间跪下。时序库能撑住，靠的是一整条专为「海量追加」设计的摄取流水线：批量缓冲、内存累积、顺序刷盘、后台压实。这条流水线把 <a href=\"../foundations/timeseries-characteristics\">时序数据的特征</a> 里「追加写主导」的优势压榨到极致。本篇拆解高吞吐摄取的每个环节及其工程权衡。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>高吞吐摄取的核心是「把随机写变成顺序写，把零散写变成批量写」。数据先在客户端或网关批量聚合，进服务端先写预写日志（WAL）保证持久，再进内存表累积，攒够后整批转列、压缩、顺序刷成不可变块，后台再做合并压实（compaction）。这正是 LSM-Tree 思想在时序场景的落地。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  A[采集端] --&gt; B[批量聚合&lt;br/&gt;攒够N条或T秒]&#10;  B --&gt; C[摄取网关&lt;br/&gt;校验/解析/路由]&#10;  C --&gt; D[写预写日志WAL&lt;br/&gt;顺序追加保证持久]&#10;  D --&gt; E[写内存表memtable&lt;br/&gt;低延迟即时可查]&#10;  E --&gt; F[攒满阈值]&#10;  F --&gt; G[转列+压缩&lt;br/&gt;刷成不可变块]&#10;  G --&gt; H[后台压实&lt;br/&gt;合并小块]\">graph TD\n  A[采集端] --&gt; B[批量聚合&lt;br/&gt;攒够N条或T秒]\n  B --&gt; C[摄取网关&lt;br/&gt;校验/解析/路由]\n  C --&gt; D[写预写日志WAL&lt;br/&gt;顺序追加保证持久]\n  D --&gt; E[写内存表memtable&lt;br/&gt;低延迟即时可查]\n  E --&gt; F[攒满阈值]\n  F --&gt; G[转列+压缩&lt;br/&gt;刷成不可变块]\n  G --&gt; H[后台压实&lt;br/&gt;合并小块]</pre><p>下表给出影响摄取吞吐的关键旋钮：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>旋钮</th>\n<th>作用</th>\n<th>调大的代价</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>批大小 batch size</td>\n<td>摊薄每次写的固定开销</td>\n<td>端到端延迟上升</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>内存表阈值</td>\n<td>减少刷盘频率</td>\n<td>内存占用、宕机恢复时间</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WAL 刷盘策略</td>\n<td>持久性保证</td>\n<td>同步刷盘拖慢吞吐</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>压实并发度</td>\n<td>控制后台合并速度</td>\n<td>抢占前台 I/O</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"批量写-摊薄固定开销\">批量写：摊薄固定开销</h2><p>每次写请求都有固定开销——网络往返、连接、解析、锁。逐点写会让这些开销主导成本。批量把 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.4306em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span> 个点合成一次请求，单点摊销开销降为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>n</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/n</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span></span></span></span></span>。</p>\n<p>设单次请求固定开销 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{fix}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>、每点边际成本 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{pt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，则批大小为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 时单点平均成本为：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>a</mi><mi>v</mi><mi>g</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi>b</mi></mfrac><mo>+</mo><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>p</mi><mi>t</mi></mrow></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{avg} = \\frac{c_{fix}}{b} + c_{pt}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">a</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">v</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.0359em;\">g</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">=</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.7936em;vertical-align:-0.686em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mopen nulldelimiter\"></span><span class=\"mfrac\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1076em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.314em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.23em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"frac-line\" style=\"border-bottom-width:0.04em;\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.677em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.686em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mclose nulldelimiter\"></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7167em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2806em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">pt</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越大，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mi>c</mi><mrow><mi>f</mi><mi>i</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">c_{fix}/b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.0361em;vertical-align:-0.2861em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">c</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\" style=\"margin-right:0.1076em;\">f</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">x</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2861em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 越小,吞吐越高。但 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span> 大意味着数据要在客户端攒更久才发出,端到端延迟上升。实践中按「攒够 N 条或等够 T 毫秒，先到先发」折中。InfluxDB 等系统的客户端 SDK 默认就带批量缓冲，官方称单实例可达每秒千万点级写入,前提正是批量摄取。</p>\n<h2 id=\"预写日志-持久性的底线\">预写日志：持久性的底线</h2><p>内存表里的数据在刷盘前若遇宕机就会丢失。预写日志（WAL）解决这点：每条写在进内存表前，先顺序追加到磁盘日志。崩溃重启后重放 WAL 即可恢复未刷盘数据。</p>\n<p>WAL 是顺序追加,比随机写快得多,但「何时把 WAL 真正落盘」是吞吐与持久性的经典权衡——每条都 fsync 最安全但最慢，攒一批再 fsync 快但宕机会丢最近一小批。多数时序库提供可调策略，监控这类「丢几秒无伤大雅」的场景常选异步批量 fsync 换吞吐。</p>\n<h2 id=\"内存表与刷盘\">内存表与刷盘</h2><p>通过 WAL 后,数据进内存表（memtable）——一个可写、可查的内存结构。它让刚写入的数据立即可被查询（告警和实时仪表盘依赖这点），同时把写入累积成批。</p>\n<p>内存表满（按大小或时间窗口）后，整批数据被转置为 <a href=\"../storage/columnar-timeseries\">列式与时序存储布局</a> 的列段，应用 <a href=\"../storage/compression-tsdb\">时序压缩：Gorilla 与 Delta</a> 的编码，顺序写成一个不可变块。刷盘是顺序大块写,对磁盘极友好。刷盘后对应的 WAL 段即可回收。</p>\n<h2 id=\"乱序与去重\">乱序与去重</h2><p>理想中数据按时间顺序到达，现实里网络重传、采集端补传、多源汇聚都会带来乱序点（时间戳早于已写入数据）和重复点。摄取管道必须处理它们。</p>\n<p>主流策略有几种：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>限制乱序窗口：只接受落在「当前时间往前若干分钟」内的点，太旧的直接拒绝，保护快路径。</li>\n<li>块内重排序：在内存表里维护有序，刷盘时已是有序块。</li>\n<li>去重规则：同序列同时间戳的点，按「后写覆盖」或「保留首条」语义处理。</li>\n</ul>\n<p>乱序点若落到已封存的不可变块，处理代价高（需重写块），所以系统普遍倾向「新数据走快路径、过旧数据特殊处理或拒绝」。这与 <a href=\"../storage/retention-downsampling\">保留策略与降采样</a> 的连续聚合刷新机制紧密相关——乱序点必须触发对应窗口摘要的重算。</p>\n<h2 id=\"背压与压实\">背压与压实</h2><p>当写入速率超过刷盘和压实的消化能力，内存会持续堆积直至 OOM。成熟系统用背压（backpressure）保护自己：内存水位过高时拒绝或限流新写入，让客户端重试或本地缓冲。</p>\n<p>后台压实把刷盘产生的许多小块合并成更少的大块，减少查询时要打开的文件数、提升压缩率。压实是后台 I/O 大户，必须与前台写入、查询争抢资源时被限速，避免「压实风暴」拖垮在线请求。摄取产生的块最终被 <a href=\"query-aggregation\">时序查询与聚合窗口</a> 读取,摄取与查询共享同一套存储,二者的资源平衡是运维核心课题。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>高吞吐摄取的本质是把随机写转顺序写、零散写转批量写，是 LSM 思想的时序落地。</li>\n<li>批量摄取把单点固定开销摊为 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mi>b</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1/b</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1/</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">b</span></span></span></span></span>，是达到每秒千万点级吞吐的前提。</li>\n<li>WAL 用顺序追加保证持久,其 fsync 策略是吞吐与持久性的经典权衡。</li>\n<li>内存表让新数据即时可查并累积成批，满后转列、压缩、顺序刷成不可变块。</li>\n<li>乱序与去重必须在摄取期处理，过旧点走特殊路径或拒绝；背压与受控压实保护系统稳定。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"高吞吐摄取","id":"高吞吐摄取"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"批量写：摊薄固定开销","id":"批量写-摊薄固定开销"},{"level":2,"text":"预写日志：持久性的底线","id":"预写日志-持久性的底线"},{"level":2,"text":"内存表与刷盘","id":"内存表与刷盘"},{"level":2,"text":"乱序与去重","id":"乱序与去重"},{"level":2,"text":"背压与压实","id":"背压与压实"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保留策略与降采样","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/storage/retention-downsampling"},"next":{"title":"时序查询与聚合窗口","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/time-series-databases/query/query-aggregation"}}